<title>USA: Investors hold stake in PMC International.</title>
<headline>Investors hold stake in PMC International.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Boston-based investor group said it holds a 7.45 percent stake, or 1,082,000 common shares, in PMC International Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group led by Bay Pond Partners LP said it bought the shares at $2.125 a share on December 23.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake in the Denver-based company for investment purposes.</p>
